  "title": "I Stopped Paying For AI Keys And Nothing Broke",
  "description": "A self-updating GitHub list tracks 26 companies giving away free API access to real models, with current rate limits for each one. Mistral offers 1 billion tokens per month, Cerebras 1 million per day, Groq 14,400 requests per day, and none of them require a credit card.\n\nThis short also fixes the mistake everyone makes: these keys are OpenAI format and Claude Code is Anthropic format, so you need a small free local router in between. Full setup for Claude Code, Cursor and n8n is in the guide.\n\nGet the full setup guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1xAJgJackVk0TPp3bGh2RKRoIz4YHtK14f-JBfDEljfg/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #AITools #ClaudeCode",
